OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happened to The Captain Tom
OL,4,AFoundation?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2020, the nation was behind Captain
OL,7,FSir Tom Moore as he walked 100 laps of
OL,8,Fhis Bedfordshire garden just before his
OL,9,F100th birthday. After raising millions
OL,10,Ffor the NHS, a charitable foundation
OL,11,Fwas set up in his name, but over the
OL,12,Fyears it has been the subject of
OL,13,Fseveral controversies. With the charity
OL,14,Fnow applying to be dissolved, this is
OL,15,Fthe story of its rise and fall.
OL,17,FIn March 2020, the nation went into
OL,18,Flockdown as coronavirus spread and the
OL,19,FNHS faced huge pressures struggling to
OL,20,Fdeal with patients with breathing
OL,21,Fdifficulties.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
