OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happened to The Captain Tom
OL,4,AFoundation?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCapt Sir Tom, who was born in Keighley
OL,7,Fin West Yorkshire, saw what was
OL,8,Fhappening and set his mind to walking
OL,9,F100 laps of his patio in Marston
OL,10,FMoretaine at the end of April in a bid
OL,11,Fto raise #1,000 for the health service.
OL,13,FHe quickly gained attention and
OL,14,Fhundreds of thousands of people from
OL,15,Facross the world started to contribute
OL,16,Fto his fundraiser.
